WEB SOURCE (the specification, read end-to-end):
  web/src/features/driving/components/drivetrain-health/TemperatureTrendChart.tsx
  + constants.ts (ChartDataPoint) + pages/DrivetrainHealthPage.tsx (data builder)
  A single-series outside-temperature line chart, one point per recent drive, with two
  reference lines (Warm Zone 35 °C, Freezing 0 °C) and a display-unit Y axis. The page
  feeds `outsideTemp: d.outsideTempAvgC ?? null` (RAW SI °C). The web guard
  `if (data.length <= 1) return null;` hides the chart for < 2 drives.

